	"FriendlyName": "Scriptable Framework - GAS Integration",
	"Description": "Adds Gameplay Ability System tasks and conditions (grant ability, send gameplay event, manage tags, etc.) to the Scriptable Framework. Requires the GameplayAbilities plugin.",
